       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INVENTORY.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY COMMON.
       01 WS-ITEM-CODE         PIC X(12).
       01 WS-QUANTITY          PIC 9(8).
       01 WS-REORDER-LEVEL     PIC 9(6).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           CALL 'DBACCESS' USING WS-ITEM-CODE.
           CALL 'LOGGER' USING 'INVENTORY-CHECK'.
           IF WS-QUANTITY < WS-REORDER-LEVEL
               CALL 'ALERT-SERVICE' USING WS-ITEM-CODE WS-QUANTITY
           END-IF.
           CALL 'DBCLOSE'.
           STOP RUN.
